            <div xml:id="d160">

                <pb facs="0548" n="428" xml:id="pg428"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">813.00 Washington/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Ramer</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-10-13T16:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">October 13,
                                1922—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 14—3:55
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>53. It is my impression after an interview with the President today that an
                    invitation from the Secretary of State for the December conference under recent
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Tacoma</hi> agreement to be held in Washington would
                    be gladly accepted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ramer</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
